{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<img alt=\"灣仔私家車失事撞壆翻側　司機涉醉駕被捕\" src=\"https://news.now.com/nownews/NewsImage/TA-WANCHAI-261022-06.jpg\"><p>【Now新聞台】灣仔昨晚有私家車失事撞壆翻側，司機涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。</p><p>私家車車身損毀，擋風玻璃碎裂，安全氣袋彈出。</p><p>昨晚10時許，該輛私家車沿夏慤道往中環方向行駛，駛至近軍器廠街時，懷疑失控撞向路中石壆後翻側，34歲男司機受傷，送往律敦治醫院治理。警方經初步調查後，司機涉嫌酒後駕駛被捕。</p></body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:34.285243+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":144,"images":1,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-21T23:30:24+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T04:38:00.178791+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-22T15:58:10.620308+00:00","content_hash":"64775a3769513b4e2a306f1a96aa3bf89c885152e18752ce3c48dcf0f8a298fe","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-22T16:02:34.285243+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}